 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 9 月，一名 Binance 工程师接到面试邀约。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 9 月，一名 Binance 工程师接到面试邀约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 1.705,
   "speechEnd": 6.379
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "邀约来自正规的招聘平台，他也参加了视频面试，看上去一切正常。",
   "spoken": "邀约来自正规的招聘平台，他也参加了视频面试，看上去一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 6.78,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 6.876,
   "speechEnd": 12.361
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "面试结束前，对方给了他一份作业。",
   "spoken": "面试结束前，对方给了他一份作业。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.76,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 12.858,
   "speechEnd": 15.505
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一个代码仓库，要他下载下来完成。",
   "spoken": "一个代码仓库，要他下载下来完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 15.94,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 15.94,
   "speechEnd": 18.888
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "他把仓库下载到了工作电脑上。",
   "spoken": "他把仓库下载到了工作电脑上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 19.28,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 19.372,
   "speechEnd": 21.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "他没有输入密码，也没有点任何钓鱼链接。",
   "spoken": "他没有输入密码，也没有点任何钓鱼链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 22.14,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 22.14,
   "speechEnd": 25.702
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "到了 10 月，攻击者从工程师的电脑出发，控制了更多同事的电脑。",
   "spoken": "到了 10 月，攻击者从工程师的电脑出发，控制了更多同事的电脑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 26.12,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 26.12,
   "speechEnd": 31.374
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "最后，他们找到了部署令牌。",
   "spoken": "最后，他们找到了部署令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 31.78,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 31.873,
   "speechEnd": 34.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "这次事件里，受影响的资产约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "这次事件里，受影响的资产约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 34.56,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 34.658,
   "speechEnd": 38.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep21/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 39.02,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 39.02,
   "speechEnd": 39.821
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "没有密码，没有链接，这份作业，是靠什么进入他电脑的？",
   "spoken": "没有密码，没有链接，这份作业，是靠什么进入他电脑的？",
